PHASE 5 - THE DUPLICATE-FORMULATION VERDICT, ANSWERED ON SUBSTANCE
================================================================================

  This is the question query 02 exists to make answerable, and it is a
  first-class finding rather than a formality: query 01 and query 02 address ONE
  handler/sink pair, so whether they are two formulations or one restated has to
  be settled on evidence. It is settled below on the SUBSTANCE - the predicate
  set, the traversal semantics, the source types and the node kinds - and not on
  the file names differing. Every measurement in this phase was taken HERE, from
  the two committed sources, and none of it needed the graph, which is why the
  halt does not touch it.

  VERDICT: not_duplicate, against query 01. Five independent bases.

  BASIS 1 - THE EDGE KINDS TRAVERSED. Query 02's only traversal primitive is
