  dataflow layer. Query 01's is NoResolve.getCalledMethodsAsTraversal, which
  walks CALL edges. Neither is expressible as the other: no call-edge traversal
  establishes that a value reaches the launch, and no reaching-definition
  traversal establishes that control can arrive there. The counts below are
