  which merely matches the pattern cannot silently join the definition.

  WHAT IS NOT A PREDICATE, and this is the line most likely to be misread.
  Master.scala:411 - if (state != RecoveryState.ALIVE) - is a RECOVERY-STATE
  check. It gates driver submission on the Master being the live master, not on
